# Pairs with EventualConvergence in ReplicationReBootstrap. A cutover that leaves the
# receiver on its original tree discards the import, so a write behind the trim point
# reaches the receiver by no path.
MODULE: EventualConvergenceCutoverKeepsLiveTree
TARGET: EventualConvergence
CLASS: Temporal
SUMMARY: the cutover keeps the original tree instead of the drained copy, so the import is lost
PERTURBS: Cutover
BOUNDS: Mutual = TRUE

--- FIND
    /\ reg' = [reg EXCEPT ![x] = cp[x]]
--- REPLACE
\* MUTATION: the cutover does not replace the tree with the copy.
    /\ reg' = reg
--- END